<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Calendario rústico - Mayo 2026</title>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg: #0b1220;
      --card: rgba(255,255,255,.06);
      --text:#e5e7eb;
      --muted:#a7b0c0;
      --gold:#f4b740;
      --violet:#7c3aed;
      --ink:#0f172a;
      --shadow: 0 22px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.55);
    }

    *{box-sizing:border-box;}

    body{
      margin:0;
      font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
      min-height:100vh;
      color:var(--text);
      background:
        radial-gradient(900px 480px at 15% 0%, rgba(124,58,237,.35), transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(760px 420px at 95% 20%, rgba(244,183,64,.26), transparent 55%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #070b15, var(--bg));
      display:flex;
      justify-content:center;
      padding:36px 16px;
    }

    .wrap{width:min(780px, 100%);}

    .top{
      display:flex;
      align-items:flex-start;
      justify-content:space-between;
      gap:14px;
      margin-bottom:14px;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
    }

    .title{
      margin:0;
      font-size:clamp(1.7rem, 2.6vw, 2.1rem);
    }

    .subtitle{
      margin:8px 0 0;
      color:var(--muted);
      line-height:1.5;
      max-width:52ch;
    }

    .chip{
      padding:10px 14px;
      background:rgba(244,183,64,.14);
      border:1px solid rgba(244,183,64,.35);
      color:#ffe4a7;
      border-radius:999px;
      font-weight:700;
      letter-spacing:.02em;
      height:fit-content;
    }

    .card{
      background:var(--card);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10);
      border-radius:20px;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      padding:18px;
    }

    table{width:100%; border-collapse:collapse;}

    .month{
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(244,183,64,.95), rgba(124,58,237,.92));
      color:#0b1220;
      font-weight:900;
      letter-spacing:.06em;
      text-transform:uppercase;
      text-align:center;
      padding:14px 8px;
      border-radius:16px;
    }

    th, td{padding:10px 4px; text-align:center; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);}
    th{color:var(--muted); font-weight:700; font-size:.9rem;}

    td{font-size:1rem;}

    .blank{background:transparent;}

    .weekday-hot{background:rgba(244,183,64,.14); color:#fff; font-weight:800;}
    .weekday-violet{background:rgba(124,58,237,.18); color:#fff; font-weight:800;}
    .highlight{background:rgba(244,183,64,.95); color:#0b1220; font-weight:900; border:2px solid rgba(124,58,237,.65);}

    .legend{
      margin-top:14px;
      padding:14px;
      border-radius:16px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      color:var(--muted);
      line-height:1.7;
    }

    .legend strong{color:var(--text);}

    .final-note{
      margin-top:14px;
      color:var(--muted);
      text-align:center;
      font-size:.98rem;
      line-height:1.55;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="top">
      <div>
        <h1 class="title">Calendario del mes (Mayo 2026)</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Una tabla con estilos diferentes para que se distingan los días marcados.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="chip">🎨 Estilo “rústico” moderno</div>
    </div>

    <section class="card">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th colspan="7" class="month">Mayo 2026</th>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>Dom</th>
            <th>Lun</th>
            <th>Mar</th>
            <th>Mié</th>
            <th>Jue</th>
            <th>Vie</th>
            <th>Sáb</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td class="blank"></td>
            <td class="blank"></td>
            <td class="blank"></td>
            <td class="blank"></td>
            <td class="blank"></td>
            <td class="highlight">1</td>
            <td>2</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>3</td>
            <td class="weekday-hot">4</td>
            <td class="highlight">5</td>
            <td>6</td>
            <td>7</td>
            <td class="weekday-violet">8</td>
            <td>9</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>10</td>
            <td class="weekday-hot">11</td>
            <td>12</td>
            <td>13</td>
            <td>14</td>
            <td class="highlight">15</td>
            <td>16</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>17</td>
            <td class="weekday-hot">18</td>
            <td class="highlight">19</td>
            <td>20</td>
            <td>21</td>
            <td class="weekday-violet">22</td>
            <td>23</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>24</td>
            <td class="weekday-hot">25</td>
            <td class="highlight">26</td>
            <td>27</td>
            <td>28</td>
            <td class="weekday-violet">29</td>
            <td>30</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>31</td>
            <td class="blank"></td>
            <td class="blank"></td>
            <td class="blank"></td>
            <td class="blank"></td>
            <td class="blank"></td>
            <td class="blank"></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <div class="legend">
        <div><strong>1 de mayo:</strong> Día del trabajo</div>
        <div><strong>5 de mayo:</strong> Batalla de Puebla</div>
        <div><strong>15 de mayo:</strong> Día del maestro</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <p class="final-note">En algunos puntos tuve que consultar referencias para lograr el diseño y que quedara bien presentado.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>

